# Buried Treasure: "{5}, Exile this card from your graveyard: Discover 5. Activate only as a sorcery." It does nothing from the
# battlefield. Sacrificed for mana (one {U} floats and pays part of the {5}) it goes to the graveyard; there the discover is refused with a
# spell on the stack (CR 602.5d) and paid only with exactly {5}. Exiling the card is a cost (CR 602.2), so the Treasure is in exile
# when it resolves. Discover 5 (CR 701.57a) exiles Island (a land) and Arachnoid (mana value 6, over the limit), then
# casts Ancient Carp (mana value 5, exactly the limit) for free; the two cards skipped go to the bottom of the library.

